very much"},{"surface":"சிறிதே","parts":[{"text":"சிறிது","lemma":"சிறிது","gloss":"small/short"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed (clitic)"}],"gloss":"is very short"}]}],"literal":"Ancient town gate cold pond having bathed / common ground neem tree's bright foliage having worn / clear drum in front of like a male elephant having walked / fierce battle Chezhiyan also came; who opposed / new warriors indeed are many! / Will they survive? The day is very short!","translation":"Having bathed in the cool pond at the gate of the ancient town, having adorned himself with the bright foliage of the neem tree from the public square, and walking like a majestic male elephant before the clear-sounding drums, Chezhiyan of fierce battles has arrived. The new warriors who have come to oppose him are indeed many! Will any of them survive? The remaining daylight is so very short!","modern":"பழமையான ஊரின் வாயிலில் உள்ள குளிர்ந்த குளத்தில் நீராடி, பொதுமன்றத்தில் உள்ள வேப்ப மரத்தின் ஒளிரும் தளிர்களைச் சூடிக்கொண்டு, தெளிந்த ஓசையுடைய முரசுக்கு முன்னால் ஆண் யானையைப் போல கம்பீரமாக நடந்து, கொடிய போரைச் செய்யும் செழியனும் வந்துவிட்டான். அவனை எதிர்த்து வந்த புதிய வீரர்கள் பலராக இருக்கிறார்கள். பகல் பொழுது மிகவும் சுருங்கிவிட்டது; இனி அவர்கள் உயிர் பிழைத்து எஞ்சுவார்களோ?","explanation":"In this poem, the poet Idaikkundrur Kizhar describes the arrival of the young Pandiyan king, Neduncheliyan, on the battlefield. The king has performed the ritual preparations for war, bathing in the cool pond of the ancient town and wearing a wreath of bright neem leaves, which is the royal emblem of the Pandiyas. He marches with the majesty of a male elephant in front of the clear-sounding war drums. Although the opposing coalition consists of many newly arrived warriors, the poet expresses doubt about their survival. The poem ends with a dramatic observation that the remaining daylight is far too short for the enemies to escape the king's swift and fierce onslaught.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,2.6],[2.6,3.1],[3.1,3.6],[3.6,4.22],[4.22,4.66],[4.66,5.1],[5.1,5.5],[5.5,6.82],[7.26,7.7],[7.7,8.2],[8.2,8.4],[8.52,8.87],[8.87,9.4],[9.4,9.7],[9.7,11.0],[11.0,11.2],[11.35,11.9],[11.9,12.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.1],[2.1,3.1],[3.1,3.4],[3.4,4.0],[4.0,4.6],[4.61,5.11],[5.11,5.73],[5.73,6.36],[6.36,6.73],[6.73,7.35],[7.35,7.98],[7.98,8.6],[8.6,9.2],[9.2,10.3],[10.3,10.63],[10.7,11.15],[11.3,12.4],[12.4,12.8],[12.8,13.5],[13.5,13.9]]},"sync":[[["மூதூர்","ancient town"]],[["வாயில்","gate"]],[["பனி","cold"],["கயம்","pond"]],[["கயம்","pond"]],[["மண்ணி","having bathed"]],[["மன்ற","of the public square"]],[["வேம்பின்","of the neem tree"]],[["ஒண்","bright"],["குழை","foliage"]],[["மிலைந்து","having worn"]],[["தெண்","clear-sounding"],["கிணை","drum"]],[["முன்னர்","in front of"],["களிற்றின்","like a male elephant"]],[["களிற்றின்","like a male elephant"]],[["இயலி","having walked gracefully"]],[["வெம்","fierce"],["போர்","battle"]],[["செழியனும்","Chezhiyan also"]],[["வந்தனன்","he came"]],[["எதிர்ந்த","who opposed"]],[["வம்ப","new"]],[["மள்ளரோ","the warriors indeed"]],[["பலரே","are many"]],[["எஞ்சுவர்","they will survive"]],[["கொல்லோ","perhaps indeed"]],[["பகல்","daytime"],["தவ","very much"],["சிறிதே","is very short"]],[["சிறிதே","is very short"]]]}